<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 2.07 BLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 2.07 BLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 2.07 billion zlotys worth of Polish T-bills at today's 1.4 billion zloty primary T-bill tender with highest demand for the 13-week and 52-week paper, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>The results of the tender should be announced later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
